kipedia.org/wiki/Adam_Hamilton_(American_politician)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Adam_Hamilton_(American_politician)"}},"extract":"Adam Joseph Hamilton is an American politician and Methodist minister who is the United States senator-elect from Kansas. A member of the Democratic Party, he is senior pastor of the United Methodist Church of the Resurrection, the largest United Methodist congregation in the United States, based in the Greater Kansas City area.","extract_html":"<p><b>Adam Joseph Hamilton</b> is an American politician and Methodist minister who is the United States senator-elect from Kansas. A member of the Democratic Party, he is senior pastor of the United Methodist Church of the Resurrection, the largest United Methodist congregation in the United States, based in the Greater Kansas City area.</p>"}